('source.iran.susa_darius_statue.achemenet','Susa: The Statue of Darius','SCHOLARLY_PROJECT',3,'Achemenet / Musee du Louvre research network','Pierre Briant project','lang.en',NULL,'2026-08-27','https://www.achemenet.com/en/visit/?/susa/the-statue-of-darius/','Darius statue overview','Project website rights apply; metadata, locators and independent summaries only','Scholarly archaeological presentation produced with museum and excavation partners','Do not package page images or extended text',0,'English project presentation','URL_SYNTAX_VALID','Records the chance discovery on 24 December 1972, preserved height, missing upper part and current display at the National Museum of Iran.'),
('source.iran.susa_darius_foundation.achemenet','Susa: The Statue on its Foundation','SCHOLARLY_PROJECT',3,'Achemenet / Musee du Louvre research network','Pierre Briant project','lang.en',NULL,'2026-08-27','https://www.achemenet.com/en/visit/?/susa/the-statue-of-darius/3=','Darius statue foundation','Project website rights apply; metadata, locators and independent summaries only','Scholarly archaeological object-context presentation','Do not package page images or extended text',0,'English project presentation','URL_SYNTAX_VALID','Describes the statue fixed with lead to two stone slabs set on a larger foundation; construction observation kept separate from itinerary reconstruction.'),
('source.iran.susa_darius_gate.achemenet','Susa: The Darius Gate','OFFICIAL_ARCHAEOLOGICAL_PROJECT',3,'Achemenet / Musee du Louvre / National Museum of Iran research network','Pierre Briant project','lang.en',NULL,'2026-08-27','https://www.achemenet.com/en/visit/?/susa/darius-gate/','Darius Gate, Susa','Project website rights apply; metadata, locators and independent summaries only','Scholarly archaeological-site presentation with institutional partners','Do not package page images or extended text',0,'English project presentation','URL_SYNTAX_VALID','Project-level record for the mud-brick gate and its archaeological context.'),
('source.iran.susa_royal_city.met1992','The Royal City of Susa: Ancient Near Eastern Treasures in the Louvre','MUSEUM_PUBLICATION',3,'The Metropolitan Museum of Art / Musee du Louvre','Prudence O. Harper; Joan Aruz; Francoise Tallon','lang.en','1992','2026-08-27','https://www.metmuseum.org/met-publications/royal-city-of-susa-ancient-near-eastern-treasures-in-the-louvre','ISBN publication, 336 pages','Publication copyright applies; the linked museum record and PDF terms govern reuse','Museum and scholarly synthesis of Susa excavation history, monuments, objects and conservation','Bibliographic data and independent summaries only; no bulk reproduction',0,'English museum publication','URL_SYNTAX_VALID','Authority-level bibliography for the wider Susa excavation setting; not used to invent an exact statue inventory number.');

