('historical.achaemenid.xerxes_i','Xerxes I','薛西斯一世','Xsayarsa','Xerxes I','HISTORICAL_FIGURE','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Achaemenid king, 486-465 BCE','阿契美尼德国王；本批仅登记其完成苏萨王宫工程及被学界归因的大流士雕像转运。 / Achaemenid king, limited here to sourced Susa building completion and the attributed statue transfer.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"reality_status":"HISTORICAL_PERSON","identity_guard":"not merged with later namesakes"}','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z'),
('site.iran.susa','Susa Archaeological Site','苏萨考古遗址','Susa','Susa','ARCHAEOLOGICAL_SITE','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Multi-period settlement; Achaemenid royal residence after ca. 520 BCE','伊朗胡齐斯坦的多时期现实考古遗址；本档案只扩展阿契美尼德王城与雕像发现语境。 / Real multi-period site in Khuzestan, here scoped to the Achaemenid royal city and statue find context.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"reality_status":"REAL_ARCHAEOLOGICAL","period_sensitive":true}','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z'),
('site.iran.susa_darius_gate','Darius Gate at Susa','苏萨大流士门','Gate of Darius','Darius Gate','ARCHAEOLOGICAL_SITE','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Begun under Darius I; completed under Xerxes I','苏萨王宫的官方入口建筑子档；与整个苏萨遗址及王宫保持独立。 / Monument-level record for the official palace entrance at Susa, distinct from the whole site and palace.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"reality_status":"REAL_ARCHAEOLOGICAL","part_of":"site.iran.susa","construction_phase_guard":true}','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z'),
('event.persia.darius_statue_transfer_egypt_susa','Reconstructed Transfer of the Darius Statue to Susa','大流士雕像转运苏萨（学术重建）',NULL,NULL,'EVENT','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Attributed to the reign of Xerxes I, after 486 BCE','学术资料重建的历史转运事件；不是现存古代叙事原文，也不把“由薛西斯带到苏萨”升级为无争议事实。 / Scholarly reconstruction of the statue transfer, not an extant ancient narrative and not treated as undisputed fact.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"reality_status":"HISTORICAL_RECONSTRUCTION","route_start":"Egypt/Heliopolis proposed","route_end":"Susa","attribution":"Xerxes I"}','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z'),
('event.archaeology.darius_statue_discovery_1972','Discovery of the Darius Statue at Susa (1972)','1972年苏萨大流士雕像发现事件',NULL,NULL,'EVENT','civ.persian','region.west_asia','24 December 1972','1972年12月24日在苏萨考古现场偶然发现雕像的现代考古事件；与古代转运事件分开。 / Modern archaeological discovery on 24 December 1972, separate from the ancient transfer reconstruction.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"reality_status":"MODERN_ARCHAEOLOGICAL_EVENT","date":"1972-12-24"}','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z'),
('institution.iran.national_museum','National Museum of Iran','伊朗国家博物馆',NULL,NULL,'INSTITUTION','civ.persian','region.west_asia','Modern museum institution','当前展示苏萨大流士雕像的现代博物馆机构；未核实的馆藏号不写入。 / Modern institution displaying the Darius statue; no unverified inventory number is asserted.','PARTIAL','SOURCE_BACKED',1,'{"institution_type":"MUSEUM","inventory_guard":"exact number remains unverified"}','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z','2026-08-27T00:00:00Z');

